count_models sperner5: 5001 models over Fin 32, embedded; count by part A N ms, verified check (parts A, B, C) N ms
count_models sperner5_stream: 5001 models over Fin 32, streamed; count by part A N ms, verified check part B N ms, parts A and C N ms
'sperner5' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound, sperner5._native.native_decide.ax_1]
